"""Rule catalog: id -> title, default severity, provenance, explanation, source URL.

`prov` says how much to trust the rule:
  wiki       stated on the BI wiki
  wiki-note  from a user note on the wiki
  tracker    reported on the BI Feedback Tracker (engine behaviour that deviates from the docs)
  inferred   logical consequence of wiki text
  community  forum posts / community wikis (terrain config Grid class, community BIS_fnc_gridToPos). Not BI-documented.
  heuristic  tunable QA threshold from this tool (NOT a BI limit)
  model      depends on this tool's approximate renderer
"""
